# [4.3.1PE] Deduplication Interval locked at 1min when set at 10min

- State: closed
- Author: AdrienAdB
- Created: 2026-03-20T09:47:04Z
- Updated: 2026-03-20T17:29:43Z
- Repository: thingsboard/thingsboard
- Number: #15276
- Assignees: mykhailokornieiev

## Labels

- unconfirmed

---

**Describe the bug**

- Calculated fields are updating every **minutes** (or more) instead of a **minimum of 10min**
- TB Instance: On-premise **4.3.1PE**

## Calculated fields configuration
- Aggregation from child
- Deduplication Interval set to 10min (Minimum time between telemetry aggregations) `"deduplicationIntervalInSec": 600`
- Childs sending data at 1-2min interval

