**AdrienAdB** commented on 2026-03-20T17:29:43Z:

> @mykhailokornieiev thank you for your fast reply.
> 
> I have found and corrected the issue, it was coming from child device rule chain.
> The node "Action - create relation" was forcing event `RELATION_DELETED`, `RELATION_ADD_OR_UPDATE` causing aggregation to reset every minutes.
> 
> All is working well now.
> Thanks.

